<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus to auction 91 day t-bills worth 15 million.</title>
<headline>Cyprus to auction 91 day t-bills worth 15 million.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cyprus's central bank will auction 91-day treasury bills worth 15 million pounds ($29.5 million) with a May 28 issue date, the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>Competitive or non competitive bids can be made for the issue from May 26 to May 28 at 9.00 a.m. local (0600 GMT).</p>
<p>($=0.508 pounds)</p>
